{"id":"601ad32e52e9aa55","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion.md","title":"稳定剖面及极小点确定性的充要判据","display":"prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion — 稳定剖面及极小点确定性的充要判据","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion","aliases":["91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion","91-prop-stability-criterion","91-prop-paradox-stability"],"display":"prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion — 稳定剖面及极小点确定性的充要判据","depends_on":["[[91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification]]","[[91-df-stable-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion</span><span>91-prop-stability-criterion</span><span>91-prop-paradox-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion — 稳定剖面及极小点确定性的充要判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da74a4922b7a5745\" href=\"?note=da74a4922b7a5745\" title=\"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification\">91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{v_X(\\varphi):X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{v_X(\\varphi):X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 采用所引六种剖面命题。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stable}_J\">\\(\\operatorname{Stable}_J\\)</span> 为所有一致固定点同值的本地稳定性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}criterion}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}criterion}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf t\\}\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf f\\}\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf t\\}\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf f\\}\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反向因为极小固定点也是被量化的一个成员；正向用包含及读码。故这两项不是仅有充分条件。稳定间隙则有剖面 {u}，例如直接说谎者。\n极小点未定义本身不能分辨 {u}、{t,u}、{f,u}、{t,f,u}；包含极小点的规范模型类没有 {t,f} 剖面。稳定指跨固定点同值，不指修正序列最终不变。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1 的极小性与固定点透明性；本地剖面分类的直接推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification","s